    description: "Declare TypedDict classes for each survey.json schema sub-structure: AnalysisRunDict, SymbolDict, EdgeDict, MetricsDict, LimitsDict, SketchPrecomputedDict, etc. Consumers that read survey.json get keys-checked at member access. Closes some WI-gogif envelope-incomplete sub-cases (the new D.3b sub-axis) at type-check time: missing required envelope fields become type errors when constructing the dict, not runtime gaps. Use total=False where appropriate; document required-key sets explicitly. Cross-ref bakeoff-validation tag if the change is claimed to reduce missing-field defects on real-repo runs."  # 2a25
